# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output (CMake presets write build-*/ next to the source)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
out/
CMakeUserPresets.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Visual Studio / VS Code / JetBrains
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
*.user
*.suo
*.wsuo
*.vsidx
.idea/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-developer agent/tool settings (the shared .claude/ config, if any,
# is committed; the *.local.json overlay never is)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS cruft
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local run / probe artifacts (regenerated, never build inputs)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
/Project-Dillen/*.jsonl
/Project-Dillen/reverse_probe_runtime.*
/Project-Dillen/native_effect_live_probe.*
/Project-Dillen/scripted_gui_overlay.*
/Project-Dillen/new_core_runtime.*
/Project-Dillen/-File

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Reference material kept beside the repository, not in it
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project-Alice-main/ is tracked already; this is the 144 MB archive of the
# same tree, so committing it would store one reference project twice.
Project-Alice-main.zip
